{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20526","headline":"移居静安坊答元八郎中 · 张籍","name":"移居静安坊答元八郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长安寺里多时住，虽守卑官不苦贫。\n作活每常嫌费力，移居祗是贵容身。\n初开井浅偏宜树，渐觉街闲省踏尘。\n更喜往还相去近，门前减却送书人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20526.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20526","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}